/S /H3
/T (Most candidates found the correct value for C in part \(a\). A large majority of candidates  realised that part \(a\) had some relevance to part \(b\) and duly wrote the integrand in terms of partial fractions and generally integrated correctly. Those who missed this step gained little or no credit for their later work. Although showing the limiting process is an area of the specification that candidates still find difficult, overall improvement continues to be noted. )
/E (Most candidates found the correct value for C in part \(a\). A large majority of candidates  realised that part \(a\) had some relevance to part \(b\) and duly wrote the integrand in terms of partial fractions and generally integrated correctly. Those who missed this step gained little or no credit for their later work. Although showing the limiting process is an area of the specification that candidates still find difficult, overall improvement continues to be noted. )
